91	     * {@code customerCode} (see {@link Region#regionOfCustomerCode(String)}) — the region-and-hash
92	     * identity is the single source of truth — or {@code 'UNKNOWN'} when no customerCode is assigned.
93	     */
94	    @AfterMapping
